\fBauro token create\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-\-scope\fR] [\fB\-\-endpoint\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-start\fR] [\fB\-\-ca\-cert\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
